``````
```{block, type='foo'}
a **block**
```
``````

to

```
\BookdownBegin{foo}

a **block**

\BookdownEnd{foo}
```

and Pandoc will convert it to

``` latex
\BookdownBegin{foo}

a \textbf{block}

\BookdownEnd{foo}
```

then I restore it to

``` latex
\begin{foo}

a \textbf{block}

\end{foo}
```

So all Pandoc's Markdown features can still be used in custom blocks.

